  "body": "### Summary\n\nMVP priority, wanted by LOT-048 (#74): only MP writes were captured (W10-W19); until public answers are captured a public reply/edit/delete is reported 'unconfirmed'. Being captured with the operator's approval in PR #258 (part A: test topic, user2).\n\n### Before you start\n\nRead AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/FIXTURES.md, tooling/fixtures/README.md, docs/lots/LOT-001-*.md and LESSONS 33/34/36/39. Write captures need the operator's approval first. Anonymize, independent leak check, Fable corpus review before any push.\n",
